'''Frostner''' is the fourth one-handed [[Clubs|club]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-hit attack combo with double damage on the last hit.
* The slower secondary attack deals 2.5x damage and 2x staggering.

Its very high knockback and [[Frost Effect|slow]] makes it a good choice for fighting multiple foes at once. These attributes in combination with different damage types make the Frostner a very effective all round weapon even in later biomes.

